		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>&quot;Update on fact&#160; (cost=1398076.01..1551054.73 rows=0 width=0)&quot;<br />&quot;&#160; -&gt;&#160; Hash Join&#160; (cost=1398076.01..1551054.73 rows=6318235 width=20)&quot;<br />&quot;&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; Hash Cond: (cmd.num_cmd = (fact.num_fact)::text)&quot;<br />&quot;&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; -&gt;&#160; Seq Scan on cmd&#160; (cost=0.00..136393.35 rows=6318235 width=23)&quot;<br />&quot;&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; -&gt;&#160; Hash&#160; (cost=1151586.56..1151586.56 rows=19719156 width=15)&quot;<br />&quot;&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; -&gt;&#160; Seq Scan on fact&#160; (cost=0.00..1151586.56 rows=19719156 width=15)&quot;</p>]]></content>
